--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e60fdf7af48f0c04bb5b0a365447b174, type: 3}
  m_Name: MrsOkaforText
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UncannyValet.Core::UncannyValet.Core.Watchers.WatcherTextAsset
  _tips:
  - _situation: 0
    _text: KEYS IN, CAR OUT. I TIME EVERYTHING.
  - _situation: 1
    _text: THAT ONE NEEDS A WASH, VALET.
  - _situation: 2
    _text: RUNNING ON FUMES. CHARGE IT, VALET.
  - _situation: 3
    _text: THAT PATRON IS ABOUT TO BLOW. MOVE!
  - _situation: 4
    _text: QUEUE'S FULL. CLEAR IT, I'M WATCHING.
  - _situation: 5
    _text: DENTS COST BLESSINGS. EASY ON THE WALLS.
  _curse:
  - THAT'S A CURSE ON THE HOUSE, VALET.
  - I SAW THAT. SHAMEFUL.
  - ANGRY PATRONS ARE BAD FOR BUSINESS.
  _perfectPark:
  - NOT A LINE OUT OF PLACE. HMM.
  - NEAT. I'VE SEEN WORSE. MUCH WORSE.
  - NICE PARKING. I SUPPOSE.
  _perfectDropOff:
  - SWIFT, SMOOTH, AT THE CURB. GOOD.
  - THE PATRON IS PLEASED. SO AM I.
  - THAT'S HOW A DROP-OFF IS DONE.
  _bigCrash:
  - MY INSURANCE WILL HEAR ABOUT THIS.
  - A CAR OR A BATTERING RAM?
  - OH, THE NOISE. THE PAPERWORK!
  _halfwayToGoal:
  - HALF THE BLESSINGS ARE IN. WELL DONE.
  - HALFWAY. DON'T GET COMFY.
  - HALFWAY. I'M ALMOST IMPRESSED.
  _goalReached:
  - ENOUGH BLESSINGS. SPLENDID.
  - GOAL MET. I HAD MY DOUBTS.
  - THAT'LL DO, VALET. THAT'LL DO.
  _last30Seconds:
  - THIRTY SECONDS. MAKE THEM COUNT.
  - CLOSING TIME SOON. FINISH STRONG.
  - TICK TOCK, VALET.
  _verdictFailed:
  - NOT ENOUGH. I EXPECTED MORE.
  - THE FAIR IS DISAPPOINTED.
  - TRY AGAIN. I'M NOT GOING ANYWHERE.
  _verdictCleared:
  - ADEQUATE. YOU MAY CONTINUE.
  - THE BLESSINGS WILL DO. THIS TIME.
  - YOU'LL GO FAR, VALET.
  _verdictClearedWell:
  - REMARKABLE. YOU HAVE MY ATTENTION.
  - I'M SURPRISED. PLEASANTLY.
  - FINE WORK. ALMOST GODLIKE.
